<title>FINLAND: PARTEK SAYS BETONILA AND PARMA TO MERGE.</title>
<headline>PARTEK SAYS BETONILA AND PARMA TO MERGE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish cargo handling equipment and construction material group Partek Oy Ab said on Thursday its precast concrete joint ventures Partek Betonila Oy Ab and Parma Oy will be merged into a new Parma/Betonila company.</p>
<p>&quot;The new Parma/Betonila company will be jointly owned by Partek Precast Concrete and Euroc Beton, a subsidiary of the Swedish Scancem ,&quot; Partek said in a statement.</p>
</text>
